Z||000030||Archie||08-15-2001||11:15 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rigdonhome:<BR><B>Archie!<P>I sent you several emails asking questions about your V8 kits...  you answered a few and then never another peep.  I'll be doing a V8 swap within a year and heard good things about your kits, but am worried about the lack of follow-up...  What's up?<P>Cheers,<BR>Scott<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I get about 250 EMails a day, sometimes I don't get them all answered. Right now there are about 340 unanswered EMails waiting for me.<P>I'll see if I can find yours.<P>Archie<P>Yep, u got mail<p>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 08-15-2001).]||||reg||1
